      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Don't see it specifically called out here, but it appears to be due to performance rank filtering being applied to the avatar you are wearing/using locally. So if I block verypoor, I can't wear my own verypoor.\n\nA temporary work around is to just set your performance settings to \"Don't Block\". I wasn't able to deduce why only some verypoor's are affected, but they appear to be newer, as in uploaded in the last few months.",
