  "details": "In beta, some avatars fail to load and show as a robot in the menu. Trying to wear these avatars fails and I appear as my own chosen fallback. A few of my most recently uploaded private avatars are affected, but I found a few public ones other people uploaded:\n\navtr_66eafc84-065d-4cc6-b627-7eda4e2ee1f4\n\navtr_82eaac01-86b9-4594-b0d1-a30188eeb2bf\n\navtr_2d57d136-b74a-40a6-ab6a-85b5fee1c5db\n\nTested this on Quest, but it happens on PC too.",
